# The private ban list tests/test_public_tree.py reads; mirrored into the
# SENTINEL_BANNED_PATTERNS Actions secret. `*.local.*` above already covers
# it, but tracking this file would publish the index it exists to withhold,
# so it is named here too rather than left to one glob.
config/banned.local.txt

